
Breakfast casserole.

Oven to 400

1 lb diced sweet potatoes
1/2 cup diced onion
4 cloves garlic
1/2 cup diced bell pepper
1 lb ground sausage
2 cups kale or spinach
12 eggs
1/2 cup milk
salt & pepper

combine sweet potatoes with 2T olive oil,
1/2 tsp salt and 1/4 tsp pepper.  Toss to coat well.
Bake on a single layer on a baking sheet 20 minutes (400)

Heat oil on a skillet, add onions and garlic.  Cook
a few minutes, then add bell pepper.  Transfer onion
mixture to 9x13 baking dish.  Cook the sausage and
add to onion mix in the baking dish.  Add the sweet
potatoes and kale/spinach.

In a bowl, wisk the eggs and milk, 1tsp salt,
1/4 tsp pepper.  Pour over the mash in the baking dish.

Bake uncovered 25-30 minutes.
